A deer slips on the ice while reaching for berries as a penguin jumps nearby, and the deer soon gasps in shock and narrows its eyes in annoyance as a steam locomotive speeds through the snowy landscape. The deer catches a berry on its tongue and tosses it while the penguin gets thrown off the deer's head, and after the penguin holds up a berry while they sit in the snow, the deer wakes up and they ride a mine cart on broken tracks inside a cave. As a penguin holds a bunch of berries and the penguin eats fruit from a bunch, the deer screams as their mine cart speeds through a tunnel, crashes through wood structures, and has a large structure fall over the shocked deer before crashing at a mineshaft exit. The crash launches the deer and the berries into the air, where the screaming, flailing, and gasping creature falls while the penguin waves before crashing into the snowy landscape below. After the penguin sits on the deer and then slides down a snowy slope, leaving the deer to lower its head and yawn on a rocky ledge, the deer looks at the penguin and other penguins holding berries in the snow, and eats berries next to the penguin while surrounded by the others.
